From u96353e7106735838 at groups.google.com  Fri Nov 19 20:12:17 2021
From: u96353e7106735838 at groups.google.com (Karl Broman)
Date: Fri, 19 Nov 2021 20:12:17 +0000
Subject: Re: read.cross Error in file(file, "rt"): cannot open the connection
Message-ID: <ABhsc8N3ooI.mwD9BJmnAwAJ@rqtl-disc.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <ABhsc8N3ooI.c_qFfg-lAwAJ@rqtl-disc.groups.google.com>
References: <ABhsc8N3ooI.c_qFfg-lAwAJ@rqtl-disc.groups.google.com>
